<title>HONG KONG: Rizal Commercial Bank sets $50 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Rizal Commercial Bank sets $50 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger LTCB ASIA.</p>
<p>BORROWER RIZAL COMMERCIAL BANKING CORP</p>
<p> AMOUNT   US$50 MLN    COUPON    3ML+75	MATURITY  5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRCD	   ISS PRICE PAR	   LAUNCH    08.OCT.96</p>
<p> PUTS     YR 3	   CALLS     YR 3	  REPLIES   18.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING  --	     REPAYMENT BULLET	DENOMS    US$250K</p>
<p> RATINGS  --	     SALE LMTS STANDARD    TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	    CRS DEF   YES	   FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY PHILIPPINES GOV LAW   ENGLISH     PAY DATE  06.NOV.96</p>
<p> NOTES    ISSUED OFF ITS US$150 MLN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>	    CO-LEAD MANAGERS US$5 MLN+    36 BP  ALL-IN 87 BP</p>
<p>	    CO-MANAGERS	US$2-4 MLN   33 BP  ALL-IN 86 BP</p>
<p>ARRANGER LTCB ASIA</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-4039</p>
</text>
